# Gabriel Bootstrap Doc Sync

- Read `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/bootstrap/FEATURE.md` and
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` before changing this area.
- Update `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/bootstrap/FEATURE.md` in the same turn whenever behavior, file ownership, load paths, settings, or dependencies change.
- When `sessionPlugins` URL list or order changes, update
  `Custom/Scripts/Gabriel/FEATURE.md` if the overview must reflect it.
- If the change crosses into another Gabriel area, update both adjacent docs.
